WEBVTT

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:26.650
I feel sorry for those people.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:31.460
They all came here
with dreams in their hearts.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:37.020
Now they huddle together like that
because they couldn't make it a reality.

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.640
But we were chosen, right?

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.560
By that El Dorado.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.900
Amazing!

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:56.570
I can never get enough of this smell.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.330
The swirl of greed and sin.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:08.210
I love this smell the most.

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:41.400
Huh?

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:55.000
I really laughed at that guy's proposal.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.420
Seriously.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.050
Oh, excuse me.

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:03.970
Isn't it such a nice night?

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:06.930
Huh? Well, um...

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.640
I can smell it.

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:14.270
The smell of happiness is such a rancid odor.

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:16.480
Wh-What can I do for you?

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:21.610
Do you know a guy named King?
I'm here to meet him.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:22.860
King?

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:25.530
N-No, we don't...

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.490
I see. Too bad.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.120
Let me apologize.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:33.290
Huh?

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:56.270
Your faces have gotten pretty cool.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.760
This is a good city.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:14.040
It'd be a waste to let
King do whatever he wants.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.030
Right?

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.720
Another troublesome
one seems to have arrived.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:46.320
The new cyber component
created by the Galley Corporation

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:49.660
far surpasses the processing speed
of our current available devices.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:54.790
We can expect a paradigm shift
in cyber technology soon.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:04.710
I-I don't know!

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:08.300
I don't know a person named King...

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:14.720
I-I'm telling the truth.
I've never heard of a name like that.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:22.480
So you don't know him.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:24.620
Sorry about that.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:28.030
My payment. Please take it.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.860
Huh? Were you watching
me the whole time?

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:10.650
I was raised to always keep
my eyes on a beautiful woman.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.580
I was just exploring the city.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.620
I just arrived yesterday.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:19.200
I see! Congratulations.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:23.830
So you were able to grasp onto
the fortune of coming to El Dorado.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.800
Yes! It really is an amazing place.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.880
Have you gone to the central area yet?

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:34.430
There is a stupidly large tower
that symbolizes El Dorado there.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:35.760
It's a sight to see.

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:39.220
I'll take a look when I have the time.

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:41.930
What is this?

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:44.270
A token of our meeting.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.940
An invitation to a social night gathering.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.440
No way. Really?

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:53.410
It's my job. If you wish, please call for me.

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:56.370
I'll escort you for cheap.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.540
Okay, I understand.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:00.750
But be careful.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:03.710
The nights of El Dorado
are filled with many temptations.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:08.100
If the inexperienced reach out
too carelessly, they get swallowed up.

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.590
Oh, goodness!

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:34.070
So laid back.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:38.200
Well, my plan is perfect.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:42.450
The Golden Knight is 
definitely getting close.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:47.460
That's fine. We don't have
to kidnap the "princess" that way.

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:49.880
I heard you failed last time?

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:56.430
Not really. We now know
their strength and personality.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:59.850
We'll meet them here fully prepared.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:04.980
King has gone into the
final adjustments of the system.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:06.850
Don't allow anyone to bother him.

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:10.650
I see. It took a lot of time.

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:13.860
With this, we'll accomplish our objective.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:16.490
That is precisely why 
there can be no mistakes.

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:19.490
If it doesn't work out, 
we'll blow it up again.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.870
Just like that experimental lab.

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:25.910
Well, that was really such a splendid scene.

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:31.250
His orders are absolute. Don't forget that.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.220
So scary. So scary.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:07.580
Thank you.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:18.470
Wow.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.670
Is this your first time here?

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.570
Y-Yes.

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:41.320
Then, you have to go up front and enjoy it!

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:42.030
U-Um...

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:46.040
What? Come on. Don't worry about it.

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.210
What do you think? Isn't this great?!

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:55.060
Yes!

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:06.310
Everyone, is this the
best night you've ever had?!

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:14.480
Well then, it's almost time for the
main event everyone's been waiting for!

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:25.120
Our special guest tonight will be...

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.340
These guys!

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:31.930
Huh?

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:33.790
Congratulations!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:36.170
S-Special guest?

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:41.130
We'll color the night with you three tonight!

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.850
U-Um, I...

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:54.310
No!

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:56.490
Huh?

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:59.150
N-No!

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:05.160
We'll color the night
with your blood and flesh!

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:09.120
As our feed.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.370
F-Feed?

00:12:25.770 --> 00:12:30.870
Now, it's time to eat!

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:36.400
N-No!

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.200
I-It's you!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:49.930
S-S-Save me! Some weird monsters!

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:57.630
Can't be helped.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:04.190
Huh?

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:18.860
Who are you?

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:23.650
What, the almighty King isn't here?

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:24.650
King, you say?

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:30.240
I'm more fit to stand on
top than some old guy like that.

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.750
Don't joke around!

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:36.250
You got in the way of our feeding!

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.380
What a cheap stink.

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:43.010
We need to eliminate
the smell from the source.

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:48.010
A guy who controls such
small fry in the background

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:50.550
shouldn't call himself King.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:01.900
The dining hall in
district 32 has gone down.

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:06.400
As you can see, he looks pretty strong.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:08.240
What nerve.

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.740
It's you we're talking about.

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.830
You probably noticed
him from the beginning.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.240
Yeah.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:16.290
But now we know his methods, right?

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.170
Where is Knight?

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.960
I was thinking of having
him take care of this.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:26.260
Then...

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:29.430
It's your job to eliminate any infiltrators.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.260
Do it yourself.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:34.310
Even though his target is King?

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:44.020
You are a truly distasteful man.

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.860
I am honored to receive
such a compliment.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:15:03.250
King. King. How admirable.

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:28.360
Th-This is the place.

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:40.000
A barrier. How careful.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:33.070
It's a good night to die.

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:35.970
King lies ahead, right?

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:40.680
That is not a name someone
like you should even speak.

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:44.600
The power of the ring?

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:47.730
An absolute power over Horrors.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:50.690
I would use it better than him.

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:55.690
I wouldn't just take a city,
but the whole continent.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:02.410
Your scent is especially strong.

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:06.010
Adoration... A loyal heart?

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:10.340
Once you're mine, I'll take good care of you.

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:17.490
Unmeasurable foolishness.

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:23.020
I became his shield by my own will.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:26.650
Someone like you wouldn't
even reach his feet in greatness.

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:28.350
I see.

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:31.360
Then, you should test me out.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:49.130
I don't dislike the smell of flowers.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:21.910
They are carnivorous flowers
from Makai. My sweet children.

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:24.370
They are insatiable and consume everything.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:28.420
Are these the claws that dare to harm him?

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:34.550
Are these the legs that
dare trample upon his land?

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:40.900
Mouths that dare dirty his name?

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:43.640
Eyes that dare to glare with malice?

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:48.560
I cannot stand such things.

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:00.700
How ugly.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.450
Shut up.

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:23.640
What?!

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:28.270
Did you think something
like this would work?

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:34.110
You bitch...

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:12.940
Impossible. You've got to be kidding.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:18.530
I told you, the careless
can get swallowed up.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:23.360
Nice to meet you. I take care of this city.

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:25.910
You... From the beginning!

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:29.790
It was pretty interesting.
Your foolish little show.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.380
It's useless.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:38.680
You're going to die here
no matter what you do.

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:40.600
Without fail.

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:45.640
You lot only desire the
things right in front of you.

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:49.140
It's truly Horror-like...

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:51.770
You're the type I hate the most.

00:20:58.190 --> 00:20:59.940
That's a good expression.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:03.400
I can never get enough of
seeing that expression on people.

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:26.680
Perfect timing.

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:30.640
Are you done with your so-called training?

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:35.440
Goodness.

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:38.650
No interest in anything
other than the Golden Knight...

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:43.580
Well, you know. Too bad for you.

00:21:57.580 --> 00:22:01.950
I will not allow anyone
to lay a finger on him.

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:12.810
Someone like you would never
understand the true worth of El Dorado.
